  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "A02_s2026",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.65
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "别动！一动，三对离婚。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "A05_s2026",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.65
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "懂！暗访。您记，随便记。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "B08_s2026",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.65
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "扣仙丹。还得写检讨。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "C02_s2026",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.65
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "牛郎织女。我绑的！牢吧？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "C04_s2026",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.65
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "……异地恋，也算成。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "C05_s2026",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.65
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "梁山伯祝英台。……变蝴蝶了。这单别记。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "C09_s2026",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.65
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "董永七仙女——那是玉帝的亲闺女。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "D01_s2026",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.65
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "来单了！月老庙，加急！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "E01_s2026",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.65
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "嘘。凡人看不见咱们。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "E05_s2026",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.65
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "哎哎哎！她左滑一下，我断一根！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "F06_s2026",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.65
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "……这个，也记，缘分未到。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "G01_s2026",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.65
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "线呢？我的线呢！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "G02_s2026",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.65
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "别动别动——缠您法器上了。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "H02_s2026",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.65
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "……我？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "H03_s2026",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.65
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "当年太忙。想着忙完这阵，就给自己绑一根。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "H04_s2026",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.65
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "这一阵，忙了一千二百年。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "H05_s2026",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 2026,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.65
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "我这个……也记，缘分未到吧。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "e9a6840c69b79812b77ea81fa11d55aaf80dcf1938fa0137bf7f514f67f75c99",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "name": "Martin Li"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
